  unitName: Blast Brigadier Buck
  unitId: 811028
  unitNumber: 8662
  description: Working on the frontlines of urban defence is rough, and that goes
    double if you happen to be a Volper, an elite among the Rezcorps guardsmen of
    Paskua's most technologically advanced military organization. You have to possess
    a keen sense of danger, a thick skull for impact, and above all, an appetite
    for controlled destruction. Despite the harsh requirements, Buck seems to be
    enjoying his career, or else he wouldn't have stayed this long.A former instructor
    in the academy, Buck was well placed to dispense his grizzled advice to fresh-fraced,
    overeager cadets. Many who enter Rezcorps dream of joining the ranks of the prestigious
    Volpers, but only a few make the cut each year, and for good reason. It's not
    enough to simply be a good guardsmen; the Volpers put their lives on the line
    for the people they lead and serve.Having seen his fair share of trials and tribulations
    throughout the years, Buck's stories are etched into his skin, each scar and
    burn a memory of a mission completed or a civilian rescued. Then there were those
    he could not save, but such grim realities come with the job; Buck would rather
    laugh it off over a pint than brood himself into oblivion.Buck currently partners
    with Lleva, a rising young boltstriker within the Volpers whose stoic and serious
    demeanor complements his laid-back calmness. The pair had met before; Buck oversaw
    her training at one point, alongside a second promising cadet named Bonnie.Who
    knew that years later, both of his trainees would come to walk their own paths
    and be reunited over a certain diabolical genius?
  summonDesc: Rezcorps Volper, Buck, at your service.<br>I've heard tell of somebunny
    kickin' up a fuss around here.
  fusionDesc: Hm?<br>Sure, why not.<br>Taking a break is important, too.
  evoDesc: Talk about a glow-up, partner!<br>Better put my pedal to the metal, now!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
